@startuml basic-api-request
!theme plain
title Basic REST API Request

actor User
participant "Web App" as App
boundary "API Gateway" as GW
participant "User Service" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

User -> App: click "View Profile"
App -> GW: GET /api/users/123
GW -> Svc ++: getUser(123)
Svc -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = 123
DB --> Svc: userRecord
Svc --> GW --: 200 {user}
GW --> App: 200 {user}
App --> User: display profile page

@enduml
